# Amazon Route-53
## AWS Route 53 is a cloud-based Domain Name System (DNS) web service.It's a highly available and scalable service that translates domain names (like www.example.com) into the IP addresses of your resources (like web servers) so browsers can locate and connect to your website. Essentially, it acts as the phone book for the internet, connecting user requests to your website
